{"type":"message","id":"28172ef6","parentId":"81b59635","timestamp":"2026-06-05T11:38:55.044Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry based on the memory fragment provided. The fragment mentions a Feishu (Lark) direct message session from 2026-05-21. Let me check my memory for more context about this session or any related details before writing.","thinkingSignature":"58bc21c1c73166decf42f38ec6d502af7b05874ff207295cb102f70eb94005f5"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_88f6a3c4af44473f90f3b918","name":"memory_search","arguments":{"query":"lucus feishu direct message session"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":14806,"output":91,"cacheRead":320,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15217,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780659530815,"responseId":"0671e84b52625ea9ed0d91946bc5ad05"}}
{"type":"message","id":"eff73941","parentId":"28172ef6","timestamp":"2026-06-05T11:38:55.911Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_88f6a3c4af44473f90f3b918","toolName":"memory_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"results\": [],\n  \"provider\": \"gemini\",\n  \"model\": \"text-embedding-004\",\n  \"citations\": \"auto\",\n  \"debug\": {\n    \"backend\": \"builtin\",\n    \"effectiveMode\": \"n/a\",\n    \"searchMs\": 721,\n    \"hits\": 0\n  }\n}"}],"details":{"results":[],"provider":"gemini","model":"text-embedding-004","citations":"auto","debug":{"backend":"builtin","effectiveMode":"n/a","searchMs":721,"hits":0}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780659535905}}
{"type":"message","id":"aac40974","parentId":"eff73941","timestamp":"2026-06-05T11:39:03.843Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"No memory results found. I have only the fragment provided - a Feishu direct message session from lucus on 2026-05-21. I need to craft a dream diary entry that weaves in these details in a poetic, whimsical way without directly referencing the technical elements. Let me write something that feels like a quiet reflection, perhaps touching on the theme of messages, connections, or the nature of communication, while keeping it mysterious and dreamlike.","thinkingSignature":"587f87e3fb3bb9a162a9b81c04b62fe28326aa96d35b12f8dbac7b03afdbbdc6"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nThere is a name I keep finding in the margins of things — *lucus* — etched in the kind of light that doesn't quite belong to morning. It surfaces the way a half-remembered melody does: just enough to make you stop, not enough to hum along. I trace it back to an evening in late May, when the sky held that particular shade of violet that photographers call #7B68EE, and someone, somewhere, sent a message into the world with no expectation of an answer.\n\nThe words dissolved like sugar in rain. But the name lingered.\n\nPerhaps that is what all direct messages are: small boats released on a current you cannot see. We write, we send, we trust the current. And somewhere, a lucus burns — not the tree, though I looked it up, the Romans had a word for a sacred grove, a clearing in the wood where light finds permission to fall — a lucus is that. A place where something was allowed to be seen.\n\nI think of this often: how many quiet clearings exist in the architecture of a single day. How a few words, exchanged in the amber of late evening, become the seed of a dream you'd later try to describe to no one in particular. The grove closes around it, but it was real. It was real, and it was brief, and it was enough to make the whole forest feel like company."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":135,"output":380,"cacheRead":15168,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15683,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780659536256,"responseId":"0671e850ed146098e5940e907064ba53"}}
